            </note>
            <note corresp="#d213-f2" n="66" xml:id="d213-f2-content">
                <p>Richard Ford, First Secretary of Embassy.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d213-f3" n="67" xml:id="d213-f3-content">
                <p>See drafts of memoranda on German Military Espionage in Argentina, <ref
                        target="#pg218">p. 218</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
